2026-09-07T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2233) 'The gates were first run, and backfilled, on the account.chibifire.com DNS rollout. `logbook-taskweft-planned-dns-traces.md` holds the full record; this file keeps the shape each gate takes.
 # tags: rfd:details-preamble
 Text:RFD2233  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-07T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2233) 'Work closes with three gates in the logbook, each with runnable apparatus. Backfilling any of them is permitted: the record is the requirement, not the timing.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2233  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-07T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2233) '1. **Red control gate.** The exact command shown failing on the broken state. Verification rule 2 in the working agreements.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2233  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-07T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2233) '2. **Green gate.** The same check shown passing on the fixed state. The probe must distinguish the two states it separates; an identity-blind probe (one that answers alike for both) does not qualify.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2233  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-07T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2233) '3. **Scout gate.** The place left better than we arrived: an inventory of the session's side effects shown non-empty before cleanup and empty after, plus what was improved beyond the task.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2233  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-09-07T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2233) '`DETAILS.md` carries the reference case with its measurements.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2233  1 LINE
 Text:Written

